    "MapFolderPick": "Choose the map folder (synced read-only)",
    "SimultaneousHelp": "Notes within this much of a group's first note form one chord group (measured from the first note, not the previous one, so groups never grow in a chain). 0 groups only notes at exactly the same time. Larger values put more notes in a group, which can run out of lanes.",
    "MinimumTileHelp": "The fewest lanes dynamic mode may choose. Slow parts never drop below it, and setting it equal to the maximum gives the same notes as turning dynamic tile count off.",
